\section{Performance}{

One export call enumerates the whole filtered register, so a cold crawl is
cheap. The per-attachment downloads (when \code{download = TRUE}) hit the SICODEI
blob host. Requests are throttled to 5 requests per second by default;
override via \code{getOption("planscanR.fr_throttle_rate")} (requests/sec; falsy
disables).
}

